{
  "_about": "Settings for scripts/collect-security-news.mjs (runs once a day, free sources only). pictures: \"pexels\" (free photos, default) or \"openai\" (paid image generation). Edit the word lists here; the collector reads them on every run. Articles and videos come from Korean media only, news abroad included (the 해외 search is in Korean). A video must come from a channel in videoChannels (matched in the channel name) and have a Korean title.",
